<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix D Metric Details ‣ Listening with Attention: Entropy-Guided Explainability for Transformer-Based Audio Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Stability (STAB).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix D Metric Details ‣ Listening with Attention: Entropy-Guided Explainability for Transformer-Based Audio Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Infidelity (INF).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In Appendix D Metric Details ‣ Listening with Attention: Entropy-Guided Explainability for Transformer-Based Audio Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reporting.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
