<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>LEAF-X Algorithm and Implementation Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix provides implementation-level pseudocode for the three variants of LEAF-X used in our experiments: <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X-Base</span>, <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Grad</span>, and <span id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Causal</span>. All variants return token-to-time attribution maps, where each decoded token <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is assigned a normalized frame-level attribution vector <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\in\Delta^{T-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\in\Delta^{T-1}</annotation></semantics></math>. The base variant uses entropy-guided attention weighting and multi-layer rollout. The gradient variant additionally modulates attention by token-level output sensitivity. The causal variant further reweights intermediate layer explanations using lightweight attention ablations.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Notation.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times d}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the acoustic feature sequence with <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> time frames and feature dimension <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})</annotation></semantics></math> denote the decoded token sequence. For token <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, layer <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l\in\{1,\ldots,L\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l\in\{1,\ldots,L\}</annotation></semantics></math>, and head <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\{1,\ldots,H\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\{1,\ldots,H\}</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}^{(l,h)}\in\Delta^{T-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}^{(l,h)}\in\Delta^{T-1}</annotation></semantics></math> be the attention distribution over acoustic frames or audio pseudo-tokens. We use <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> as the entropy temperature and <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math> as a numerical stability constant.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span><span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X-Base</span>: Entropy-Guided Token-to-Time Attribution</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.6.1" class="ltx_listingline">





















































<div id="alg1.6.1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 ASR model <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, acoustic features <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math>, decoded tokens <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})</annotation></semantics></math>, rollout depth <math id="alg1.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, heads <math id="alg1.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math>, entropy temperature <math id="alg1.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, stability constant <math id="alg1.l0.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Token-to-time attribution maps <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}=\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}=\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Run <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}(X)</annotation></semantics></math> and cache cross-attention or audio-token attention maps <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{a_{i}^{(l,h)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{a_{i}^{(l,h)}\}</annotation></semantics></math> for all tokens, layers, and heads.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each decoded token <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each layer <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each head <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Compute normalized head entropy:

<table id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="H_{i}^{(l,h)}=-\sum_{t=1}^{T}a_{i,t}^{(l,h)}\log(a_{i,t}^{(l,h)}+\epsilon)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi>log</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i}^{(l,h)}=-\sum_{t=1}^{T}a_{i,t}^{(l,h)}\log(a_{i,t}^{(l,h)}+\epsilon)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Convert entropy to confidence weight:

<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{l,h}(i)=\left(1-\frac{H_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\log T+\epsilon}\right)^{1/\tau}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{l,h}(i)=\left(1-\frac{H_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\log T+\epsilon}\right)^{1/\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Compute entropy-weighted layer attention:

<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{a}_{i}^{(l)}=\frac{\sum_{h=1}^{H}w_{l,h}(i)a_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\sum_{h=1}^{H}w_{l,h}(i)+\epsilon}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{a}_{i}^{(l)}=\frac{\sum_{h=1}^{H}w_{l,h}(i)a_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\sum_{h=1}^{H}w_{l,h}(i)+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Normalize <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{a}_{i}^{(l)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{a}_{i}^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math> so that <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{t}\bar{a}_{i,t}^{(l)}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{t}\bar{a}_{i,t}^{(l)}=1</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Initialize rollout attribution:

<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i}^{(1)}=\bar{a}_{i}^{(1)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i}^{(1)}=\bar{a}_{i}^{(1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each layer <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=2</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Propagate attribution using the effective layer attention operator:

<table id="A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i}^{(l)}=\Pi^{(l)}R_{i}^{(l-1)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i}^{(l)}=\Pi^{(l)}R_{i}^{(l-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Normalize <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i}^{(l)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i}^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l15.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Obtain final token-to-time attribution:

<table id="A1.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}=\frac{R_{i}^{(L)}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}R_{i,t}^{(L)}+\epsilon}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}=\frac{R_{i}^{(L)}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}R_{i,t}^{(L)}+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Add <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l18.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span><span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Grad</span>: Gradient-Modulated Entropy Rollout</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.6.1" class="ltx_listingline">





















































<div id="alg2.6.1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 ASR model <math id="alg2.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, acoustic features <math id="alg2.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math>, decoded tokens <math id="alg2.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>, rollout depth <math id="alg2.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, number of heads <math id="alg2.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math>, entropy temperature <math id="alg2.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, stability constant <math id="alg2.l0.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Token-to-time attribution maps <math id="alg2.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}=\{s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}\}_{i=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>grad</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>grad</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}=\{s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}\}_{i=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Run <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}(X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}(X)</annotation></semantics></math> and cache attention maps <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{a_{i}^{(l,h)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{a_{i}^{(l,h)}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg2.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each decoded token <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Compute token score <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{i}\leftarrow\log p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{i}\leftarrow\log p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg2.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each layer <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=1,\ldots,L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=1,\ldots,L</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each head <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h=1,\ldots,H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h=1,\ldots,H</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Compute attention sensitivity:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                  
                  
                     <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow\left|\frac{\partial q_{i}}{\partial a_{i}^{(l,h)}}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow\left|\frac{\partial q_{i}}{\partial a_{i}^{(l,h)}}\right|</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Modulate attention:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                  
                  
                     <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow a_{i}^{(l,h)}\odot g_{i}^{(l,h)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow a_{i}^{(l,h)}\odot g_{i}^{(l,h)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Normalize <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}</annotation></semantics></math> so that <math id="alg2.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{t=1}^{T}\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{t=1}^{T}\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}=1</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Compute entropy:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                  
                  
                     <math id="alg2.l12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tilde{H}_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow-\sum_{t=1}^{T}\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}\log\!\left(\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}+\epsilon\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mpadded style="width:1.146em;" width="1.146em"><mi>log</mi></mpadded><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{H}_{i}^{(l,h)}\leftarrow-\sum_{t=1}^{T}\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}\log\!\left(\tilde{a}_{i,t}^{(l,h)}+\epsilon\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    Compute entropy confidence:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
                  
                  
                     <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)\leftarrow\left(1-\frac{\tilde{H}_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\log T+\epsilon}\right)^{1/\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)\leftarrow\left(1-\frac{\tilde{H}_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\log T+\epsilon}\right)^{1/\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <span id="alg2.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l15.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg2.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Aggregate heads:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    <math id="alg2.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}\leftarrow\frac{\sum_{h=1}^{H}\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\sum_{h=1}^{H}\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)+\epsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}\leftarrow\frac{\sum_{h=1}^{H}\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)\tilde{a}_{i}^{(l,h)}}{\sum_{h=1}^{H}\tilde{w}_{l,h}(i)+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Normalize <math id="alg2.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg2.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">20:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Initialize rollout:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">21:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <math id="alg2.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(1)}\leftarrow\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>a</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(1)}\leftarrow\bar{a}_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(1)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">22:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg2.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each layer <math id="alg2.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=2,\ldots,L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=2,\ldots,L</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l22.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l23.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">23:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Propagate attribution:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l24.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">24:</span></span>
                  
                  
                    <math id="alg2.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}\leftarrow\Pi^{(l)}R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l-1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}\leftarrow\Pi^{(l)}R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l-1)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l25.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">25:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Normalize <math id="alg2.l25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l26.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">26:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg2.l26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.6.1.1.4" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg2.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l27.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">27:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Compute final attribution:

</div>
<div id="alg2.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l28.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">28:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   <math id="alg2.l28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}\leftarrow\frac{R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(L)}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}R_{i,\mathrm{grad},t}^{(L)}+\epsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>grad</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>grad</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}\leftarrow\frac{R_{i,\mathrm{grad}}^{(L)}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}R_{i,\mathrm{grad},t}^{(L)}+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l29.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">29:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Add <math id="alg2.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>grad</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{\mathrm{grad}}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l29.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>grad</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l30" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l30.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">30:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg2.l30.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l30.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l31" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l31.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">31:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg2.l31.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg2.l31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>grad</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\mathrm{grad}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span><span id="alg3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Causal</span>: Lightweight Causal Layer Reweighting</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.6.1" class="ltx_listingline">





















































<div id="alg3.6.1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 ASR model <math id="alg3.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, acoustic features <math id="alg3.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math>, decoded tokens <math id="alg3.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math>, intermediate rollout maps <math id="alg3.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{s_{i}^{(l)}\}_{l=1}^{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{s_{i}^{(l)}\}_{l=1}^{L}</annotation></semantics></math>, stability constant <math id="alg3.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Causally reweighted token-to-time attribution maps <math id="alg3.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}=\{s_{i}^{\text{causal}}\}_{i=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}=\{s_{i}^{\text{causal}}\}_{i=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 Run the unmodified model and compute token losses:

<table id="A1.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell(i)=-\log p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell(i)=-\log p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg3.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each decoded token <math id="alg3.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg3.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each layer <math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg3.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Temporarily ablate the layer-<math id="alg3.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> audio-to-text attention contribution.

</div>
<div id="alg3.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Run the ablated model and compute:

<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{abl}}^{(l)}(i)=-\log p_{\theta}^{(l\text{-abl})}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mtext>abl</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-abl</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{abl}}^{(l)}(i)=-\log p_{\theta}^{(l\text{-abl})}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                  
                  
                   Estimate layer-level causal effect:

<table id="A1.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\ell_{l}(i)=\ell_{\text{abl}}^{(l)}(i)-\ell(i)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mtext>abl</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\ell_{l}(i)=\ell_{\text{abl}}^{(l)}(i)-\ell(i)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  <span id="alg3.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg3.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Convert positive loss increases into layer weights:

<table id="A1.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{l}(i)=\frac{\max\{\Delta\ell_{l}(i),0\}}{\sum_{k=1}^{L}\max\{\Delta\ell_{k}(i),0\}+\epsilon}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{l}(i)=\frac{\max\{\Delta\ell_{l}(i),0\}}{\sum_{k=1}^{L}\max\{\Delta\ell_{k}(i),0\}+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.6.1.1.4" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="alg3.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Combine intermediate rollout maps:

<table id="A1.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{\text{causal}}=\sum_{l=1}^{L}\gamma_{l}(i)s_{i}^{(l)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{\text{causal}}=\sum_{l=1}^{L}\gamma_{l}(i)s_{i}^{(l)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Normalize:

<table id="A1.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{\text{causal}}=\frac{s_{i}^{\text{causal}}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}s_{i,t}^{\text{causal}}+\epsilon}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{\text{causal}}=\frac{s_{i}^{\text{causal}}}{\sum_{t=1}^{T}s_{i,t}^{\text{causal}}+\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                  
                  
                  Add <math id="alg3.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}^{\text{causal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}^{\text{causal}}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg3.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg3.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg3.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                  <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                  
                  
                 <span id="alg3.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span>  <math id="alg3.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mtext>causal</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{\text{causal}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Implementation notes.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For encoder-decoder ASR models such as Whisper, LEAF-X uses decoder cross-attention to map decoded tokens to encoder acoustic frames. For speech-augmented decoder-only models, the same procedure is applied to the attention mass assigned to audio pseudo-tokens, which are then mapped back to the corresponding acoustic time indices. In practice, the frame index is converted to waveform time using the feature extractor hop size and any encoder downsampling factor. We set <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon=10^{-8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon=10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math> for all normalization operations and tune <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> over a small validation sweep, typically <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in[0.5,2.0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in[0.5,2.0]</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Computational cost.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X-Base</span> requires one standard forward pass with attention caching and is therefore the cheapest variant. <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Grad</span> adds one backward pass per analyzed token or token batch to obtain attention sensitivities. <span id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-X+Causal</span> adds up to <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> ablation forward passes per analyzed token, but can be restricted to a subset of layers or disabled when low-latency auditing is required. This creates a practical trade-off: the base variant is suitable for fast inspection, the gradient variant improves sensitivity to token likelihood, and the causal variant provides the strongest audit signal when additional computation is acceptable.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Formal Task Definition for Token-to-Time ASR Explanation</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We formalize the explanation problem addressed by LEAF-X as
<em id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">token-to-time attribution</em> for transformer-based ASR. Let
<math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times d}</annotation></semantics></math> denote an acoustic feature sequence,
where <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of audio frames and <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> is the feature
dimension. Given an ASR model <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, the model produces a
decoded token sequence <math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})</annotation></semantics></math> with token probabilities
<math id="A2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(y_{i}\mid y_{&lt;i},X)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For each decoded token <math id="A2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, the goal is to produce an attribution
vector</p>
<table id="A2.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\in\Delta^{T-1},\qquad\sum_{t=1}^{T}s_{i,t}=1," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo rspace="2.000em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\in\Delta^{T-1},\qquad\sum_{t=1}^{T}s_{i,t}=1,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i,t}</annotation></semantics></math> measures the contribution of acoustic frame <math id="A2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> to the
prediction of token <math id="A2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. A complete explanation is therefore a token-to-time attribution map</p>
<table id="A2.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}(X,y)=\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}(X,y)=\{s_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">A desirable ASR explanation should satisfy three properties:
<em id="A2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">faithfulness</em>, where high-attribution frames affect the token
likelihood when removed or restored; <em id="A2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">temporal grounding</em>, where
attributions align with the spoken evidence for the token; and
<em id="A2.p3.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">stability</em>, where explanations remain consistent under small
label-preserving audio perturbations. LEAF-X instantiates this task by
using entropy-guided attention weighting, multi-layer rollout, and
optional causal reweighting to obtain sparse and temporally grounded
token-level explanations.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>LEAF-X Benchmark Protocol</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We define <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LEAF-XBench</span>, a compact evaluation protocol for
<em id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ASR explainability</em> and <em id="A3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">token-to-time attribution</em>. Given
an audio input <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math>, a transformer ASR model first produces a decoded
token sequence <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=(y_{1},\ldots,y_{N})</annotation></semantics></math>. Each explanation method then
returns a frame-level attribution map <math id="A3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times T}</annotation></semantics></math>,
where <math id="A3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i,t}</annotation></semantics></math> measures the acoustic evidence assigned to frame <math id="A3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>
for token <math id="A3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. This protocol evaluates whether an explanation is
faithful, temporally grounded, sparse, stable, and useful for auditable
ASR.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Protocol.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each model and dataset, we apply the following steps:
(i) decode the transcript using the frozen ASR model;
(ii) extract token-to-time or frame-level attribution maps;
(iii) map model frames back to the audio timeline;
(iv) compare attributions against forced word-level alignments when
available;
(v) evaluate faithfulness using deletion/insertion behavior and
infidelity;
and (vi) report stability under small label-preserving audio
perturbations such as mild noise and time shift.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="A3.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">LEAF-XBench<span id="A3.T4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> protocol for transformer ASR explanation.
Lower is better for D-AOPC and INF; higher is better for TLoc, SPR, and STAB.</span></span></figcaption>
<table id="A3.T4.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A3.T4.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Setting</span></th>
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">D-AOPC<math id="A3.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">TLoc<math id="A3.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">SPR<math id="A3.T4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">STAB<math id="A3.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th>
<th id="A3.T4.6.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">INF<math id="A3.T4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T4.6.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T4.6.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Whisper + LibriSpeech</span></th>
<td id="A3.T4.6.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.45</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.72</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.70</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.78</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A3.T4.6.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.45</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.6.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T4.6.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Canary-Qwen + TED-LIUM 3</span></th>
<td id="A3.T4.6.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.48</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.70</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.68</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.76</span></td>
<td id="A3.T4.6.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T4.6.3.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.47</span></td></tr>
