</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T9.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:68.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T9.5.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparing ASR explanation methods</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T9.5.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T9.5.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:74.0pt;">
<span id="A7.T9.5.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T9.5.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">D-AOPC, TLoc, SPR, STAB, and INF with attribution maps</span></span>
</span></td>
